-05-05T10:28:50.257","@type":"sc:Dataset","name":"Gurgaon Real Estate Dataset of 2024","url":"https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/nikhilmehrahr26/gurgaon-real-estate-dataset/versions/1","description":"****Gurgaon Real Estate Dataset****\n**Overview**\nThe Gurgaon Real Estate Dataset is a collection of property listings and associated information from the real estate market in Gurgaon, India. This dataset offers valuable insights into property prices, trends, and factors influencing the real estate market in one of India\u0027s prominent cities.\n\n**Content**\nThe dataset contains the following columns:\n\n**Price:** The price of the property.\n**Status: **The status of the property (e.g., for sale, sold, under construction).\n**Area:** The area (in square feet) of the property.\n**Locality:** The locality or area in Gurgaon where the property is situated.\n**Builder Name:** The name of the builder or developer of the property.\n**RERA Approval:** Indicates whether the property has RERA (Real Estate Regulatory Authority) approval.\n**BHK_Count:** The number of bedrooms, hall, and kitchen in the property.\n**Society: **The name of the society or residential complex where the property is located.\n**Company Name:** The name of the company associated with the property.\n**Flat Type:** The type of flat or property (e.g., apartment, villa, penthouse).\n\n****Potential Applications****\nThe Gurgaon Real Estate Dataset can be used for various applications, including but not limited to:\n\n**Predictive modeling:** Predicting property prices based on factors such as area, locality, and amenities.\n**Market analysis:** Analyzing trends and patterns in the real estate market to identify investment opportunities.\n**Decision support:** Assisting buyers, sellers, and investors in making informed decisions regarding property transactions.\n**Policy formulation:** Providing insights to policymakers and regulators for effective regulation and governance of the real estate sector."}